{"resourceIdentifier":"2706","resourceName":"Shuangbaotai AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Jiangsu Province","description":"The project introduces new animal waste management systems to treat the manure from 4 swine farms in Jiangsu Province. Each subsidiary swine farm will install one animal waste management system, and the manure is treated on site. The purpose of the project activity is to treat the manure and wastewater to avoid methane emissions generated in the baseline uncovered anaerobic lagoons. \r\nThe project activity uses flushing system to collect the manure automatically. All the manure and wastewater are collected and then be separated first. The solid will be treated in aerobic composting system and the organic fertilizers will be produced, most of the fertilizer is distributed to local farmers for free and only a small portion will be sold on the domestic market. The liquid will be treated through anaerobic digestion and the biogas generated during the treatment process will be captured for electricity generation. The sludge produced from anaerobic digestion will be treated through aerobic composting together with the solid, the effluent will be supplied to the farmers living around free for agriculture irrigation.\r\nIt is estimated that approximately 676 tons of animal manure will be handled daily by the AWMS. The biogas released during the anaerobic digestion will be collected and used for electricity production. The annual electricity production is estimated to be 19,254MWh. Also, the generated electricity will be only used for daily operation of the AWMS and the 4 swine farms themselves and will not be connected to the region grid net or other users. For conservativeness, baseline emissions from power generation are neglected. The project activity will reduce of GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of swine manure and wastewater.","location":{"latitude":32.771800,"longitude":120.778000},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-01-04","endExclusive":"2022-02-04","endInclusive":"2022-02-03"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"2706"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangsu Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shuangbaotai Animal Husbandry Group Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province, China"},{"type":"string","value":"snowgirl1984@hotmail.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"2706"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"150212"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"16/12/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 10/06/2020 - 09/06/2030"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=59650&IDKEY=n903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdf082257350","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"PD-Shuangbaotai AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Jiangsu Province-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-01-04T16:44:59.123Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=57342&IDKEY=lq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfh979074618","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Shuangbaotai AWMS GHG Mitigation Project in Jiangsu Province.pdf","uploadDate":"